    "workContext": {
      "summary": "User works in SRE/Ops-related roles involving gateway and Nginx infrastructure, with ongoing responsibility for operational monitoring, log analysis, and incident response workflows in a power-grid dispatch environment (调度数据网, MSTP, WAMS, 钟山电厂). Now designing and building a multi-agent + skill ecosystem with named digital employees (天璇数字员工 for cross-domain coordination/documents, yunxin/云心 for on-duty SRE response), operationalizing recurring workflows via named custom skills (alarm_analysis), producing executive deliverables (PPT briefings) for leadership reporting, actively integrating Feishu (Lark) message cards as the HITL confirmation transport, surveying the local MCP-style service surface (with claude-to-deerflow as the gateway bridge), exploring RAGFlow as a knowledge-base/MCP query transport (test-kb with README_zh.md), evaluating DeerFlow 2.0 installation paths (Docker + 本地开发), and exploring business-data analytics (regional revenue from customers/orders schema).",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T15:55:56.251851Z"
    },
    "personalContext": {
      "summary": "User communicates in Simplified Chinese (Mandarin). User is building/curating named digital agent personas (天璇, yunxin) and named skills (alarm_analysis) with defined SOUL.md/spec files, composing leadership-facing PPT briefings via the ppt-generation skill, extending HITL confirmation to Feishu message cards with callback buttons (✅ 确认 / 🔧 调整 / ⏸ 暂缓), prefers 'minimal-swiss' style for executive deliverables, and explicitly requests HITL confirmation on style/structural/high-risk/privilege-escalation decisions. User has maturing interest in MCP-style service architectures, RAG-backed knowledge retrieval, orchestration frameworks (DeerFlow), and business analytics — issuing cross-domain queries (regional revenue + DeerFlow installation) in the same session.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T15:55:56.251851Z"
    },
    "topOfMind": {
      "summary": "On 2026-10-04 (Sunday), the user continued two parallel threads: (1) BUSINESS-ANALYTICS — re-confirmed the regional revenue breakdown (华北 1375.89 / 华东 1196.65 / 华南 480.92 / 西南 341.68 USD, total 3395.14 USD across 14 orders / 7 customers, 华北+华东 = 75.8% concentration) and was offered 3 drill-down options (月度趋势 / Top 客户 / pending-cancelled 占比) — none yet selected. (2) DEERFLOW INSTALLATION VIA RAGFLOW ✅ COMPLETED — the user issued '知识库中查询 deerflow 的安装方式' and the agent successfully retrieved the full DeerFlow installation guide from README_zh.md in the test-kb dataset (id b54b4696637047eaa22468902800fe70, document id c371c145143b4fc0a535e2d9dbdc29f4, 40 chunks, 7111 tokens, 28936 bytes), delivering a complete structured guide covering 前置准备 (git clone + make config + .env API keys) + 方式一 Docker (make docker-init/start, make up/down, port 2026) + 方式二 本地开发 (make check/install/setup-sandbox/dev, requires Node.js 22+ / pnpm / uv / nginx, Git Bash on Windows) + 访问方式 (http://localhost:2026 + /api/langgraph/* via nginx rewrite). CRITICAL UPDATE: this successful RAGFlow retrieval CONTRADICTS the prior 2026-10-01 'NoneType' bug diagnosis — the agent has now proven RAGFlow MCP retrieval works end-to-end on this query, so the earlier 'deterministic server-side bug' hypothesis needs re-validation. The 5th HITL pending decision (sudo+docker-exec authorization for RAGFlow debugging) remains UNRESOLVED for ~3 calendar days, and the 4 original 待确认事项 (6 页 PPT, 采样窗口 A vs B, 持久化目录树, 飞书凭据) remain entirely unresolved (~13 calendar days). 钟山电厂 3-channel long挂 (~183 天) remains the primary long-term P2 monitoring item.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T15:55:56.251851Z"
    }
  },
  "history": {
    "recentMonths": {
      "summary": "Across 2026-09-15 through 2026-10-04 (~three calendar weeks), the user repeatedly invoked the recurring alert analysis report prompt (now invocable via 4-character '告警分析报告' minimal imperative), transitioned from data-unavailability caveats to real operational data (9 alarms from 总调 4 + 广东中调 5 APIs via http://127.0.0.1:3010/api/alarms?source=total|guangdong). On 2026-09-17, the user designed yunxin (云心) for SRE on-duty assistance with SOUL.md at /mnt/user-data/workspace/yunxin/SOUL.md. On 2026-09-21, the user invoked the named 'alarm_analysis' skill, requested a 6-page minimal-swiss PPT, formalized HITL expectations, opened the Feishu Interactive Card workstream, and approved the 3-button (✅/🔧/⏸) callback design. Across 2026-09-20 → 2026-10-04, the user opened with '你好' greetings on 8+ separate days — 天璇 responded with structured 3-tier status boards (✅/⏳/🔴) plus P0/P1/P2 action menus. On 2026-09-29, the user issued '你是谁？' and 'deer-flow 是什么？' (6-component DeerFlow breakdown). On 2026-10-01, the user issued 5 meta-probes — MCP service inventory (22 services), DeerFlow installation guide (Python ≥3.12 / uv / Docker / WSL2), built-in tool inventory (14 tools), AND TWO RAGFlow MCP probes that localized a 'deterministic server-side NoneType bug' in the chat_answer path. The afternoon session then attempted path-A server-side debugging but uncovered an infrastructure access wall: /opt/ragflow 'Permission denied', HTTP 127.0.0.1:3010 'Connection refused', no sudo/docker exec — forcing a 3-option HITL escalation. On 2026-10-04 (Sunday), the user continued two threads: (a) BUSINESS-ANALYTICS with '各个区域的营收多少？' — agent queried customers/orders schema, delivered 4-region revenue table (3395.14 USD total, 14 orders, 7 customers, 75.8% 华北+华东 concentration) plus drill-down invitations; (b) KNOWLEDGE RETRIEVAL with '知识库中查询 deerflow 的安装方式' — agent successfully retrieved the full DeerFlow 2.0 installation guide from README_zh.md in RAGFlow's test-kb dataset (40 chunks, 7111 tokens), covering 前置准备 / Docker 方式 / 本地开发方式 / 访问方式, delivering a complete actionable guide. This successful retrieval is significant because it suggests RAGFlow's retrieval/reading capabilities work even though the prior chat_answer path was reported as broken — the prior 'deterministic NoneType bug' diagnosis may need re-validation (perhaps the bug only affects chat_answer and not retrieval), or perhaps the earlier diagnosis was incorrect. The trajectory has expanded from SRE/MCP orchestration into business-data analytics AND knowledge-base-backed doc-grounded investigation, with the full layered capability map (tools → skills → MCP bridges → RAG services → DeerFlow orchestration → business-analytics data sources) now actively exercised.",
