      "content": "On 2026-09-29 (Tuesday afternoon, same day as '你是谁？' probe), the user issued the knowledge-probe 'deer-flow 是什么？' — opening a new investigation thread into ByteDance's DeerFlow multi-agent orchestration framework.",
