      "source": "bde3af55-cff3-4d9e-aa4a-4954398464bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "fact_9e758080",
      "content": "DeerFlow (Deep Exploration and Efficient Research Flow) is ByteDance's open-source super-agent orchestration framework — currently hosted at https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow, positioned as a 'long-horizon super-agent harness' for orchestrating sub-agents, memory, sandboxes, and extensible skills. Originally a Deep Research framework, it has evolved into a production-grade multi-agent orchestration platform.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-30T18:40:21.418403Z",
      "source": "bde3af55-cff3-4d9e-aa4a-4954398464bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "fact_306dc424",
      "content": "DeerFlow has 6 core components: (1) Sub-agents — dynamic dispatch by task hierarchy and complexity, (2) Memory system — cross-session/cross-task context and state persistence, (3) Sandboxes — isolated safe execution environments supporting code running and file operations, (4) Skills — extensible functional modules with progressive/on-demand loading to minimize Token consumption, (5) Message Gateway — integration with external IM/notification systems, (6) LangGraph workflow — state-machine orchestration via LangGraph. Built on LangChain/LangGraph with modular/pluggable design supporting custom skill files.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-30T19:05:38.073963Z",
      "source": "bde3af55-cff3-4d9e-aa4a-4954398464bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "fact_0ff539f6",
      "content": "DeerFlow is officially positioned as a '长时任务 SuperAgent 脚手架' (long-horizon SuperAgent harness) — a scaffold/orchestration framework for orchestrating multiple sub-agents, memory, sandboxes, and extensible skills to complete complex tasks ranging from minutes to hours. Evolved from an original Deep Research framework into a production-grade agent orchestration platform.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-30T19:05:38.073963Z",
      "source": "bde3af55-cff3-4d9e-aa4a-4954398464bd"
    },
