    {
      "id": "fact_09995294",
      "content": "DeerFlow 2.0 installation prerequisites: Python ≥ 3.12, uv (recommended package manager from astral-sh, alternative pip), Docker Desktop / Docker Engine + Compose v2 (required for sandbox mode), supported OS: macOS / Linux / WSL2 (Windows requires WSL2). Install uv via `curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh`.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:51:43.806510Z",
      "source": "bde3af55-cff3-4d9e-aa4a-4954398464bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "fact_a3a5f2f9",
      "content": "DeerFlow 2.0 supports two parallel installation paths: (1) Docker 一键启动 (Docker one-click start — main path, includes sandbox support), and (2) 本地源码开发模式 (local source-code development mode via uv) for developers who need to customize the framework.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:51:43.806510Z",
