      "content": "On 2026-10-01 (Thursday morning), the user issued the meta-probe '列出所有工具' (list all tools) — opening an investigation into the model-side built-in tool surface as a complement to the MCP-service and DeerFlow probes. The agent produced a 14-tool inventory refactored by '运维可用性'视角 into 2 categories: 信息检索类 5 (web_search, web_fetch, fetch_url, http_request, image_search) and 文件与代码类 9 (read_file, write_file, str_replace, ls, glob, grep, view_image, present_files, ask_clarification). ask_clarification is explicitly noted as '中断执行并向你提问（人在回路强制点）' — the in-session HITL forcing function.",
