    {
      "id": "fact_bbd39c6c",
      "content": "The built-in tool surface has 14 tools (fig: 5 + 9 = 14), categorized as: 信息检索类 (Information Retrieval 5): web_search (联网搜索), web_fetch (抓单个网页正文, with Jina 代理), fetch_url (直连 URL, no proxy, supports intranet), http_request (full HTTP client GET/POST/PUT/DELETE/PATCH), image_search (联网搜图). 文件与代码类 (Files & Code 9): read_file, write_file (支持 append, 80KB 上限), str_replace (局部替换), ls (列目录树 2 层), glob (按 glob 找文件), grep (文件内容正则搜索), view_image, present_files (呈现文件给用户, supports download), ask_clarification (中断执行并提问, 人在回路强制点).",
