      "content": "On 2026-10-01 (Thursday), the user issued a confirmation probe '测试一下 ragflow 工具查询 deerflow 是什么？' — designed to reproduce the prior 3× 'NoneType' object is not subscriptable failure from the morning session. The agent successfully re-ran the full MCP flow: ragflow_list_datasets → test-kb confirmed; ragflow_create_chat → session 'DeerFlow 安装助手' created with session_id 6314dccbb16d4e3c9b1b3ff956b03656; ragflow_chat × 3 → ALL 3 attempts failed with the SAME 'NoneType' object is not subscriptable error. The user explicitly ran a 'hello' test query which ALSO failed identically, ruling out (a) KB contents, (b) query relevance, and (c) dataset readiness as causes — pinpointing the failure to the RAGFlow server-side chat_answer serialization path (where the server performs a subscript access like response['data']['answer'] against None).",
