    {
      "id": "fact_3f4f413a",
      "content": "DeerFlow 2.0 installation guide (from README_zh.md in RAGFlow test-kb, retrieved 2026-10-04): (1) 前置准备 — `git clone https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow.git && cd deer-flow` then `make config` to generate config.yaml, edit config.yaml with at least one model (e.g., gpt-4 or OpenRouter Gemini 2.5 Flash), set API keys in `.env` (TAVILY_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY / INFOQUEST_API_KEY). (2) 方式一 Docker (recommended) — `make docker-init` (first time/image update, pulls sandbox image), `make docker-start` (dev mode, hot reload + source mount), `make up` (prod mode, build+start), `make down` (stop+remove). Access via http://localhost:2026, /api/langgraph/* rewritten to Gateway by nginx. (3) 方式二 本地开发 — requires Node.js 22+, pnpm, uv, nginx (run `make check` to verify); Windows requires Git Bash (native cmd/PowerShell NOT supported, WSL not guaranteed); commands: `make install` (backend + frontend deps), `make setup-sandbox` (optional, pre-pull sandbox image), `make dev` (start service). Access via http://localhost:2026. Environment variables: DEER_FLOW_PROJECT_ROOT, DEER_FLOW_CONFIG_PATH supported.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-04T15:55:56.251851Z",
      "source": "de7a08d2-8509-4e71-93ab-4d00e63a4c7a"
    },
