      "content": "DeerFlow 2.0 本地开发 (local development) mode on Windows requires Git Bash — native cmd/PowerShell is NOT supported, and WSL is not guaranteed to work. This is a platform-specific constraint from the official README_zh.md.",
      "category": "knowledge",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-04T15:55:56.251851Z",
