    {
      "id": "fact_92dbcd4e",
      "content": "On 2026-10-04, regional revenue breakdown (completed-order 口径, USD, 2-decimal) delivered via SQL: `SELECT c.region, ROUND(SUM(o.amount),2) AS revenue, COUNT(DISTINCT c.id) AS customer_count, COUNT(o.id) AS order_count FROM orders o JOIN customers c ON o.customer_id=c.id WHERE o.status='completed' GROUP BY c.region ORDER BY revenue DESC`. Results: 华北 1375.89 (2 customers, 4 orders), 华东 1196.65 (2 customers, 7 orders), 华南 480.92 (2 customers, 2 orders), 西南 341.68 (1 customer, 1 order), 合计 3395.14 USD across 7 customers and 14 orders. 华北+华东 = 2572.54 USD = 75.8% concentration. Source: warehouse.main customers+orders schema. The 3 offered drill-down options (月度趋势 / Top 客户 / pending-cancelled 占比) were NOT selected by the user.",
