      "content": "CRITICAL FINDING on 2026-10-04: RAGFlow MCP retrieval of document content from test-kb's README_zh.md SUCCEEDED end-to-end — the agent retrieved 40 chunks (7111 tokens, 28936 bytes) and parsed the DeerFlow installation guide into a complete structured deliverable. This CONTRADICTS / NARROWS the prior 2026-10-01 diagnosis of a 'deterministic server-side NoneType bug affecting chat_answer serialization'. The retrieval path appears functional even though the chat_answer path was previously reported as broken — suggesting the bug is narrower than originally concluded (likely specific to chat_answer, not retrieval), or that re-validation is needed.",
